Notes and behavior changes

AI pool is now top-200 by quoteVolume after light filters; FT pool is top-50 by abs(priceChangePercent).
Only aiPool members go through the heavy checks (depth/spread, 40-klines backtest, final forecast generation). If any heavy-step fails, the coin is demoted and appended to FT (so UI will show it as FT with no deepseek forecast).
FT picks are still chosen from ftPool with light checks (stddev <= TIER_FT.maxRelStdDevPct, MIN_PRICE_FT and MIN_QUOTEVOL_FT).
Demotion logs now include the actual thresholds used (min price, min volume, max spread, min depth, backtest thresholds), to help tuning.
I left the rest of the scanner logic and the SSE / forecast output behavior intact (AI picks only get forecastsBySymbol[symbol].source === 'deepseek').
